  "speechStart": 0,
  "speechEnd": 24.869,
  "chunks": [
   {
    "text": "Then the bell rings, and reality keeps score.",
    "start": 0,
    "end": 2.737
   },
   {
    "text": "At Friday's open, our model missed NVIDIA by 6 basis points, inside its range.",
    "start": 3.364,
    "end": 8.304
   },
   {
    "text": "Thursday's close missed by 146.",
    "start": 8.874,
    "end": 11.511
   },
   {
    "text": "Across 174 stock openings, only 6 landed below the range a",
    "start": 12.127,
    "end": 16.176
   },
   {
    "text": "lender would value collateral at.",
    "start": 16.176,
    "end": 18.48
   },
   {
    "text": "And through ERC-8183 jobs, a forecaster is only paid when the",
    "start": 18.914,
    "end": 23.344
   },
   {
    "text": "open proves it right.",
    "start": 23.344,
    "end": 24.869
   }
